{"id":57892,"date":"2026-08-08T14:34:35","date_gmt":"2026-08-08T13:34:35","guid":{"rendered":""},"modified":"2026-10-25T00:16:16","modified_gmt":"2026-10-24T23:16:16","slug":"maratona-de-praga","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/maratona-de-praga\/","title":{"rendered":"Maratona de Praga 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Maratona de Praga 2027<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Maratona de Praga 2027<\/strong> (<em>Vodafone Prague International Marathon<\/em>) realiza-se no domingo, <strong>2 de maio de 2027<\/strong>, com partida \u00e0s <strong>08h00<\/strong> na monumental <strong>Pra\u00e7a da Cidade Velha (Starom\u011bstsk\u00e9 n\u00e1m\u011bst\u00ed)<\/strong>, em <strong>Praga, Rep\u00fablica Checa<\/strong>. Organizada oficialmente pelo <strong>Juniorsk\u00fd maratonsk\u00fd klub, z.s. \/ RunCzech s.r.o.<\/strong> e distinguida com o selo <em>World Athletics Elite Label Road Race<\/em>, esta maratona fundada em 1995 \u00e9 reconhecida mundialmente como um dos percursos urbanos mais belos da Europa.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Ao som do poema sinf\u00f3nico <em>Vltava (O Moldava)<\/em> de Bed\u0159ich Smetana, os atletas partem em frente ao c\u00e9lebre Rel\u00f3gio Astron\u00f3mico de Praga, atravessam a ic\u00f3nica <strong>Ponte Carlos (Karl\u016fv most)<\/strong> e percorrem as duas margens do rio Moldava com vistas privilegiadas para o Castelo de Praga, o Teatro Nacional, o Bairro Judeu (Josefov) e a Casa Dan\u00e7ante, num tra\u00e7ado maioritariamente plano e r\u00e1pido. De acordo com o regulamento geral da liga RunCzech, a dist\u00e2ncia de <strong>42,195 km<\/strong> (dispon\u00edvel a n\u00edvel individual ou em duplas <strong>2Run<\/strong> de 2x 21,1 km, al\u00e9m das categorias especiais <em>Medical Run<\/em> e <em>Rescue and Security Service<\/em>) exige <strong>idade m\u00ednima de 18 anos<\/strong> no dia da corrida e disp\u00f5e de um generoso <strong>tempo limite de 7h00<\/strong> (ritmo m\u00e9dio de 09:45 min\/km), com classifica\u00e7\u00f5es gerais determinadas pelo tempo l\u00edquido (<em>chip time<\/em>). No s\u00e1bado, 1 de maio de 2027, o recinto da Expo acolhe a <em>dm Family Mile<\/em> e a <em>dm Bambini Run<\/em>. Consulta tamb\u00e9m o guia completo das principais <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/maratona\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Maratonas em Portugal<\/a> e planeia o teu ritmo na nossa <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Calculadora de Pace<\/a>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">2 de Maio de 2027 \u00e0s 08:00<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Pra\u00e7a da Cidade Velha (Starom\u011bstsk\u00e9 n\u00e1m\u011bst\u00ed), Praga, Rep\u00fablica Checa<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">42,2 km e Estafeta 2Run (2x 21,1 km)<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Juniorsk\u00fd maratonsk\u00fd klub, z.s. \/ RunCzech s.r.o.<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Tempo Limite (Cut-off)<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">7h00 (Ritmo limite: 09:45 min\/km)<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Regulamento Oficial<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.runczech.com\/en\/for-you\/for-runners\/rules-and-general-information-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;\"><br \/>\n                    \ud83d\udcc4 Consultar Regulamento Oficial &rarr;<br \/>\n                <\/a><\/span><\/li>\n<div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Maratona<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Vodafone Prague Marathon (Individual)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 2 Mai \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 08:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase (1\u20131.500 dorsais):<\/strong> 70,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (Lota\u00e7\u00e3o inicial)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase (1.501\u20134.000 dorsais):<\/strong> 95,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (Lota\u00e7\u00e3o interm\u00e9dia)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">3\u00aa Fase (4.001+ dorsais):<\/strong> 120,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (Fase final)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Maratona<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Vodafone Prague Marathon 2Run (Duplas 2x 21,1 km)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 2 Mai \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 08:00<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data, hor\u00e1rio e local de partida da Maratona de Praga 2027?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A Maratona de Praga 2027 realiza-se no domingo, 2 de maio de 2027, com partida oficial \u00e0s 08h00 e chegada na Pra\u00e7a da Cidade Velha (Starom\u011bstsk\u00e9 n\u00e1m\u011bst\u00ed), no centro hist\u00f3rico de Praga, Rep\u00fablica Checa.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite e a idade m\u00ednima para participar na Maratona de Praga?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Nos termos do regulamento oficial da RunCzech, o tempo limite m\u00e1ximo para concluir os 42,195 km \u00e9 de 7 horas desde o tiro de partida (ritmo m\u00e9dio de 09:45 min\/km). A idade m\u00ednima obrigat\u00f3ria quer para a Maratona individual quer para a estafeta em dupla (2Run) \u00e9 de 18 anos completos no dia da prova.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quanto custa a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o na Maratona de Praga 2027?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o individual nos 42,195 km est\u00e1 dividida em tr\u00eas escal\u00f5es por volume de inscritos: 70,00 \u20ac (do 1\u00ba ao 1.500\u00ba inscrito), 95,00 \u20ac (do 1.501\u00ba ao 4.000\u00ba inscrito) e 120,00 \u20ac (a partir do 4.001\u00ba inscrito), acrescida de uma taxa de servi\u00e7o RunCzech entre 2,00 \u20ac e 3,00 \u20ac consoante o valor total da encomenda.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e como \u00e9 feito o levantamento do dorsal (Start Pack)?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O levantamento do dorsal e kit de participante \u00e9 realizado exclusivamente na feira desportiva Marathon Expo Prague (em V\u00fdstavi\u0161t\u011b Hole\u0161ovice) na sexta-feira e no s\u00e1bado anteriores \u00e0 prova, mediante apresenta\u00e7\u00e3o de documento de identifica\u00e7\u00e3o oficial e do perfil Runners ID (ou autoriza\u00e7\u00e3o online pr\u00e9via na conta Runners ID para recolha por terceiros, n\u00e3o havendo envio postal).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funciona a cronometragem e o chip nas provas da RunCzech?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O chip eletr\u00f3nico da Maratona e da categoria 2Run vem integrado no dorsal e \u00e9 descart\u00e1vel (n\u00e3o necessita de devolu\u00e7\u00e3o na meta). Desde setembro de 2025, a classifica\u00e7\u00e3o geral oficial nas corridas RunCzech \u00e9 apurada pelo tempo real l\u00edquido (chip time, desde o tapete de partida at\u00e9 \u00e0 meta), mantendo-se o tempo bruto (gun time) apenas para o pelot\u00e3o de elite.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Maratona de Praga 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-05-02\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Pra\u00e7a da Cidade Velha (Starom\u011bstsk\u00e9 n\u00e1m\u011bst\u00ed), Praga, Rep\u00fablica Checa\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Praga\", \"addressRegion\": \"Rep\u00fablica Checa\", \"addressCountry\": \"CZ\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Juniorsk\u00fd maratonsk\u00fd klub, z.s. \/ RunCzech s.r.o.\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a data, hor\u00e1rio e local de partida da Maratona de Praga 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A Maratona de Praga 2027 realiza-se no domingo, 2 de maio de 2027, com partida oficial \u00e0s 08h00 e chegada na Pra\u00e7a da Cidade Velha (Starom\u011bstsk\u00e9 n\u00e1m\u011bst\u00ed), no centro hist\u00f3rico de Praga, Rep\u00fablica Checa.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite e a idade m\u00ednima para participar na Maratona de Praga?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Nos termos do regulamento oficial da RunCzech, o tempo limite m\u00e1ximo para concluir os 42,195 km \u00e9 de 7 horas desde o tiro de partida (ritmo m\u00e9dio de 09:45 min\/km). A idade m\u00ednima obrigat\u00f3ria quer para a Maratona individual quer para a estafeta em dupla (2Run) \u00e9 de 18 anos completos no dia da prova.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quanto custa a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o na Maratona de Praga 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o individual nos 42,195 km est\u00e1 dividida em tr\u00eas escal\u00f5es por volume de inscritos: 70,00 \u20ac (do 1\u00ba ao 1.500\u00ba inscrito), 95,00 \u20ac (do 1.501\u00ba ao 4.000\u00ba inscrito) e 120,00 \u20ac (a partir do 4.001\u00ba inscrito), acrescida de uma taxa de servi\u00e7o RunCzech entre 2,00 \u20ac e 3,00 \u20ac consoante o valor total da encomenda.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde e como \u00e9 feito o levantamento do dorsal (Start Pack)?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O levantamento do dorsal e kit de participante \u00e9 realizado exclusivamente na feira desportiva Marathon Expo Prague (em V\u00fdstavi\u0161t\u011b Hole\u0161ovice) na sexta-feira e no s\u00e1bado anteriores \u00e0 prova, mediante apresenta\u00e7\u00e3o de documento de identifica\u00e7\u00e3o oficial e do perfil Runners ID (ou autoriza\u00e7\u00e3o online pr\u00e9via na conta Runners ID para recolha por terceiros, n\u00e3o havendo envio postal).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como funciona a cronometragem e o chip nas provas da RunCzech?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O chip eletr\u00f3nico da Maratona e da categoria 2Run vem integrado no dorsal e \u00e9 descart\u00e1vel (n\u00e3o necessita de devolu\u00e7\u00e3o na meta). Desde setembro de 2025, a classifica\u00e7\u00e3o geral oficial nas corridas RunCzech \u00e9 apurada pelo tempo real l\u00edquido (chip time, desde o tapete de partida at\u00e9 \u00e0 meta), mantendo-se o tempo bruto (gun time) apenas para o pelot\u00e3o de elite.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":70413,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","